    "status": "healthy",
    "description": "Twenty healthy nonsmokers of Protocol 1 (prior euglycemia, no alprazolam; 'Protocol 1 ... (n = 20)'), recreationally active. The paper gives sex, age, BMI and VO2max only for the pooled 31 (16 males, 15 females) of the four day-1 conditions, used here. Age 28 +/- 1 years (data are mean +/- SE), SD computed here as SE x sqrt(31) = 5.57. BMI 23 +/- 3 kg/m2 as printed; whether SD or SE is not labelled, so no SD given. VO2max 39 +/- 2 mL/kg/min (pooled)."
  },
  "protocols": [
    {
      "name": "exercise_euglycemia",
      "description": "Day 2, after an overnight 10 h fast: 120 min tracer equilibration then 90 min cycling at 50% of individual VO2max, with 20% dextrose infused to hold glucose at the target 5.2-5.3 mmol/L (glucose clamp 5.3) for the duration of the study; no insulin infusion is described for day 2; day 1 was euglycemic clamps without alprazolam (not simulated). Activity level = (0.5 x 39 mL/kg/min - 3.7) / 31.7 = (19.5 - 3.7) / 31.7 = 0.498, using the pooled mean VO2max 39 +/- 2 mL/kg/min",
      "duration_min": 211,
      "start_hour": 8.0,
